WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.452
Today is two words that end in the same sound.

2
00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:05.481
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:05.981 --> 00:00:07.526
Say the first word. To.

4
00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:12.735
The last letter is the heart part. Here it makes the sound at the end of zoo.

5
00:00:13.185 --> 00:00:14.171
The word is to.

6
00:00:14.871 --> 00:00:16.646
Now the second word. You.

7
00:00:18.073 --> 00:00:23.114
Then two letters that make one sound. It is the same sound, the one at the end of zoo.

8
00:00:23.564 --> 00:00:24.550
The word is you.

9
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.603
A heart part can be one letter, or two. Your child draws one heart under it.

10
00:00:30.053 --> 00:00:33.753
Then step away. For job two, press play on the sound track.

11
00:00:34.203 --> 00:00:41.526
Job three brings back the words from days two and three. Read right away means a check mark, and a box on the chart.
